   "h": 112,
   "color": "light-blue",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "2. Scaffold the project from the kit\nscripts/pull_kit.sh + new-video.sh\n⏱ 30 s"
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "x": 885,
   "y": 150,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "light-blue",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "3. Sync clips to the voice recording\nscripts/build_base.py\n⏱ 73 s"
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "x": 1160,
   "y": 150,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "light-blue",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "4. Render the 1080p base video\nscripts/build_base.py\n⏱ 4 min"
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "x": 1160,
   "y": 278,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "light-blue",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "5. Transcript with word timings (Whisper small)\nwhisper --word_timestamps\n⏱ 5 min"
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "x": 1435,
   "y": 150,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "light-blue",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "6. OCR of the screen every 2 s (Apple Vision)\nscripts/ocr_all.sh\n⏱ 5 min"
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "x": 1710,
   "y": 150,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "light-blue",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "7. Captions, repeats, personal windows, report\nbuild_subs, find_repeats, find_perso\n⏱ 15 s"
  },
  {
   "id": "s8",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 1360,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "orange",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "8. Read REPORT.md, write slides, cuts, speed-ups, ending, OKRs\noverlays.json, cuts.json, okr.json\n⏱ 15 min (est.)"
  },
  {
   "id": "s9",
   "x": 335,
   "y": 1110,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "light-blue",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "9. Blur boxes from OCR, noise check\nbuild_blurs.py, denoise_audio.py\n⏱ 60 s"
  },
  {
   "id": "s10",
   "x": 610,
   "y": 1360,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "orange",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "10. Stills and Studio check of the new edits\nnpx remotion still, Studio\n⏱ 5 min (est.)"
  },
  {
   "id": "s11",
   "x": 885,
   "y": 1110,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "light-blue",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "11. YouTube export (the full video)\nscripts/render_export.sh\n⏱ 28 min"
  },
  {
   "id": "s12",
   "x": 1160,
   "y": 1110,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "light-blue",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "12. LinkedIn and X cuts\nscripts/render_export.sh ... linkedi\n⏱ 13 min"
  },
  {
   "id": "s13",
   "x": 1435,
   "y": 1110,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "light-blue",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "13. Privacy check of every export (OCR)\nscripts/verify_export.py\n⏱ 4 min"
  },
  {
   "id": "s14",
   "x": 1710,
   "y": 1110,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "light-blue",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "14. Measure, score, rebuild every page\nmeasure_video.py, build_okr.py, buil\n⏱ 2 min"
  },
  {
   "id": "s15",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 2070,
   "w": 240,
   "h": 112,
   "color": "light-blue",
   "fill": "semi",
   "text": "15. Upload to Azure and make read-only links\nscripts/upload_exports.py\n⏱ 60 s (est.)"
  },
  {
   "id": "s16",
